F1: One state object `S`; `mulberry32`/`rnd(S)` used everywhere (no `Math.random` found); `endTurn()` follows fixed numbered phases 2–14. Score 2.

F2: `S.tiles` len 64, 8-wide grid; terrain assigned via `rnd(S)` in `newState`; `canBuild` checks `b.terr.indexOf(t.terrain)`; `adjBonus()` multiplies into `buildingEff()`. Score 2.

F3: ore→metal (forge), ash→soil (composter), soil+water→food (greenhouse) via `runPhase`; `capOf()`+`addRes()` enforce caps; `S.overflow` logged. Score 2.

F4: `makeColonist` gives id/skill/fatigue/morale/job/assign; `effOf()` reads skill & fatigue, feeds `buildingEff()`. Score 2.

F5: `popNeed()` consumption each turn; `foodShort/waterShort` reduce morale in step 10; morale feeds `effOf()`; recovery via `d+=2.5` when fed. Score 2.

F6: 12 nodes in `RESEARCH`; `buyResearch` enforces `pre[]` and deducts cost; `techMult()` applies real multipliers read in `buildingEff()`; other nodes unlock buildings via `req`. Score 2.

F7: 15 entries in `EVENTS` (≥10); weighted draw in `fireEvent` via `e.w`; 5 choice events (pneumonia, refugees, infest, oldmap, strike) each mutate state differently; `S.cooldown[id]=cd` enforced. Score 2.

F8: `priceOf()` uses scarcity (`S.res[r]/cap`) and `S.market.drift[r]` (random-walk in `tickMarket`); `S.caravan.stock` decremented; `tradeBuy`/`tradeSell` both mutate `S.res`. Score 2.

F9: Storms every 5 turns, `sev` scales with `S.turn`; `t.integrity` damaged, read by `buildingEff()` (disabled <25); `stormMitigation()` reduced by windbreak/storm_shutters/relay; `doRepair` costs parts. Score 2.

F10: `serialize(S)` → JSON text in textarea; `deserialize()` validates fields, throws typed errors caught by UI `flash()`. Score 2.

F11: Lose = `S.people.length===0`; win = turn≥60 & pop≥12 & needsMet in `checkEnd`; `scoreOf()` combines pop/research/stock/turns/buildings/victory; `renderSummary()` modal. Score 2.

F12: `data-tab` click handler switches `TAB`; log entries carry `e.t` turn; extensive `data-tip` tooltips with math breakdowns; keydown handles Space + digit tab shortcuts; `@media max-width:560px` reflow. Score 2.

F13: Tests assert real invariants (`'No resource goes negative...'`, `'Damaged buildings produce less...'`); `runBenchmark()` runs 200 headless turns via `greedyTurn`, returns `stateHash()`. Score 2.

G1: `techMult(S,key)` checks `S.research.indexOf`, multiplied directly into `buildingEff()` every turn, shown in tile tooltip. Score 4.

G2: shortage → `d -= 6+...` on morale in `endTurn` step 10 → `effOf()` scales by `0.40+0.60*(morale/100)` → `buildingEff()`. Fully wired each turn. Score 4.

G3: storm damages `t.integrity` → `buildingEff()` multiplies by `t.integrity/100` (0 below 25) → `doRepair()` spends parts and resets to 100. Score 4.

G4: `priceOf()` reads `S.res[r]/cap` (scarcity) and `S.market.drift[r]` (mean-reverting walk in `tickMarket`), used in both buy/sell. Score 4.

G5: `resolveChoice` calls `c.apply(S)` which writes `S.res`, `S.people`, morale/fatigue directly (e.g. `refugees` pushes colonists, `pneumonia` deducts parts/fatigue) — not just `logMsg`. Score 4.

